### cadastrar funcionario
POST http://localhost:3000/funcionario
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Paula",
    "email": "paula@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc"
}


### cadastrar motorista
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Maria",
    "cnh": "23232",
    "cpf": "12345678912",
    "telefone": "41 99456-70934"
}


### cadastrar carga
POST http://localhost:3000/carga
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "descricao": "Sapatos 4cx",
    "peso": 3.54,
    "volume": 2.32,
    "codRastreio": "12436kxcFNOQW234",
    "idMotorista": 1
}


### cadastrar entrega
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "destino": "Itajaí",
    "status": "TRANSITO",
    "data": "2026-08-20 15:00",
    "idCarga": 1
}

